{"version":1,"content":"<p>據CNBC報道，亞馬遜創始人傑夫·貝佐斯(Jeff Bezos)表示，英偉達董事會應該選擇一名公司內部人士接替黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)，出任新CEO。他還表示，如果由他決定，他「不會聘用外部人士」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586920.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:17:26.007442+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321844+00:00","content_hash":"cd0d2f932f740642d2846a81fb25457f035563b09faa8d6e765eb7034110d18a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}